('webengage', 'WebEngage', 'startup', 'Omni-channel Marketing Automation & Retention Platform uses data and data analytics', 'Provider of customer engagement and retention platform. It is a customer data platform and marketing automation suite that manages user engagement and retention, automates communication across a users lifecycle, and helps companies send messages via different channels. Its features include omnichannel engagement, customer segmentation, data integration, marketing analytics, web personalization, and more. It caters to various industries such as gaming, travel and hospitality, entertainment, and more.', 'http://webengage.com/', 'Mumbai', 'Maharashtra', 'AI', 'Enterprise Applications > Big Data Analytics > MarketingTech', 'Series B', '2011', 'Avlesh Singh', 'GTI Capital Group, Blume Ventures, India Quotient, Social Capital, India Angel Network', '$32.7M', 19.07392, 72.83635, '', 'live'),
('entropik', 'Entropik', 'startup', 'AI based platform for market research solutions', 'AI based platform offering market research solutions. Its features include predictive insights, marketing research analytics, integrating quantitative and qualitative research, tracking, measuring, and decoding consumer behavior, and more. The platform empowers research, marketing, and product teams to capture user feedback in a more continuous, collaborative, and scalable manner by democratizing research and insights data across the organization.', 'https://www.entropik.io/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'AI', 'Enterprise Applications > MarketingTech > Consumer Insights', 'Series B', '2016', 'Rajan Kumar', 'Bharat Innovation Fund, Sea Global Services and Bessemer Venture Partners', '$35M', 12.99749, 77.62199, '', 'live'),
('spashta-technologies', 'Spashta Technologies', 'startup', 'Decision platform with component library and an interpreted language (Scython) for organising the components and…', 'Provider of supply chain management solutions. The company offers data analysis, decision-making solutions that manage the procurement process, manufacturer & supplier collaboration. The solution provides features like product planning& scheduling, demand forecasting, inventory planning, supplier sourcing, and many more.', 'https://spashtatech.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Logistics', 'SCM Software > Suite', 'Pre-seed', '2016', 'Seshadri Lakshminarayanan, Jayan Moorkanat', '', '', 12.98858, 77.59008, '', 'live'),
('suyoga-software-solutions-pvt-ltd', 'Suyoga Software Solutions Pvt Ltd', 'startup', 'Agritech E-commerce Company. Platform that integrates the complete supply chain F2F', 'Suyoga Kisaan manages supply chain from farm to consumer for fruits and vegetables. It has developed a mobile app (for Android devices) through which farmers can intimate the company the readiness of harvest and the expected produce quantity. Through the app consumers can give the orders and pay online. The company procures the produce from the farm, manages the transportation and delivers the produce to the consumer.', 'https://suyoga.co.in/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Agritech', 'Crop Tech > ECommerce', 'Pre-seed', '2016', 'Damodhar Paleti, Founder &', '', '', 12.94404, 77.64387, '', 'live'),
('saddlepointtech-com', 'Saddlepointtech.com', 'startup', 'Offers integrated cloud-based supply chain planning, optimization, and digitization suite', 'Saddle Point Technologies offers integrated cloud-based supply chain planning, optimization, and digitization suite. Its modules include facilities location optimizer, demand planner, inventory optimizer, supply network optimizer, production planner and scheduler, procurement optimizer, dispatch optimizer, vehicle route planner, global optimized order fulfillment, TMS, WMS. It has clients spread across the globe and F&B, FMCG, FMEG, Consumer Durables, Pharma, and Chemicals. Its micro-vertical solutions cater to the specific planning needs of each industry and the adaptive planning keeps the plan aligned to the supply chain disruptions.', 'https://saddlepointtech.com/', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Logistics', 'SCM Software > Planning & Analytics', 'Pre-seed', '2014', 'Arup Kar', '', '', 17.42599, 78.42843, '', 'live'),
('tap2trade', 'Tap2Trade', 'startup', 'eRFI / RFQ Platform with an integrated Bidding Platform (Auction Engine) and solution ability for ePOs', 'Tap2Trade is a provider of cloud-based source-to-pay solutions. Its platform enables sourcing, procurement, management of RFQs, reverse and forward auctions, spend analytics, vendors, PO generation, orders, bidding, negotiation and auctioning. It caters to the FMCG, logistics, manufacturing, automotive and medical sectors.', 'https://tap2trade.com/', 'Noida', 'Delhi NCR', 'Logistics', 'SCM Software > Spend Management', 'Pre-seed', '2016', 'Akshayy Jaithalia, Mohit Bajaj, Satya Narayan Singh', '', '', 28.53848, 77.4416, '', 'live'),
('aurigraph', 'Aurigraph', 'startup', 'Decentralized cryptocurrency payment system', 'Aurigraph is a distributed and decentralized cryptocurrency payment system. Offers multicast protocol for public and permission networks, and multi-sig and multi-currency wallet. Offers a distributed ledger and store with decentralized search', 'http://www.aurigraph.io/home', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Fintech', 'Banking Tech > Open Banking', 'Seed', '2018', 'Subbu Jois', 'NASSCOM', '260K', 12.93686, 77.62548, '', 'live'),
('mojro', 'Mojro', 'startup', 'Provider of SaaS-enabled logistics transportation planning and supply chain optimization solutions', 'Provider of SaaS-enabled logistics transportation planning and supply chain optimization solutions. It offers freight services as well as a customized SaaS platform to manage transportation & logistics services. The platform enables users to track shipments & manage operations. Additionally, they also offer planning & execution services enabling businesses to streamline their supply chain.', 'http://www.mojro.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Logistics', 'Logistics Tech > Freight', 'Seed', '2016', 'Kishan Ashwath, Co-Founder &, Amit Kulkarni, Ranganath Seetharamu', 'UKV Enterprises, 1Crowd, Lemon Innovision Ventures, Naga Mills', '$1.65M', 12.98321, 77.57768, '', 'live'),
('instavans', 'InstaVans', 'startup', 'Provider of a cloud-based 4PL transportation management system', 'InstaVans is a provider of a cloud-based transportation management system. Its features include shipment tracking, invoice creation, load management automation, ERP integration, route planning, and optimization, document tracking, and reverse bidding. It also provides an integrated marketplace for trucking services, with access to a carrier pool.', 'http://www.instavans.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Logistics', 'Logistics Tech > Freight', 'Seed', '2014', 'Vinay Goyal, Founder &, Sanjay Shah, Vikas Goyal', 'Freight Tiger, Lets Transport, Karzo, Cargomatic, Flexport', '$3.03M', 12.94828, 77.55351, '', 'live'),
('karpine', 'Karpine', 'startup', 'Developer of decentralized digital twin development tools for retail', 'Karpine provides track and trace solutions for supplychain using blockchain and IOT to create a digital inventory to provide alternate streams of data for underwriting SME financing', 'https://www.karpine.io/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Logistics', 'SCM Software > Digital Twin', 'Seed', '2021', 'Krishna C, Vamsi Krishna Chintala', 'AIC NITTE', '$55K', 12.99561, 77.6211, '', 'live'),
('vestago-innovation', 'Vestago Innovation', 'startup', 'App-based freight transportation marketplace for agribusinesses and F2 F SCM Solution', 'App-based freight transportation marketplace for agribusinesses. It is a freight transportation marketplace that connects agribusinesses/farmers with carriers to book freight transportation services (of agricultural cargo) in selected locations. The company partners with carriers and enables users to search & compare freight transport services. Users can also track the services in the real-time and make online payments. Its mobile app is available for Android devices.', 'https://www.vesatogo.com/', 'Nashik', 'Maharashtra', 'Agritech', 'Logistics Tech > Freight', 'Seed', '2018', 'Akshay Dixit, Ashish Mhalankar, Sagnika Chakraborty', 'Sahyadri Farms', '$34.8K', 20.02043, 73.82761, '', 'live'),
('edgistify', 'Edgistify', 'startup', 'Integrated supply chain solutions for businesses', 'Integrated supply chain solutions for businesses. It offers a warehouse and fulfillment platform that allows businesses to manage inventory, hyperlocal, and e-commerce orders. It provides features such as hyperlocal order fulfillment, e-commerce order fulfillment, and dark store operations.', 'https://edgistify.com/', 'Mumbai', 'Maharashtra', 'Logistics', 'SCM Software > Warehouse Management', 'Seed', '2017', 'Antim Suman, Kamal Kishore Kumawat, Umang Shukla', '', '$879K', 19.1255, 72.83694, '', 'live'),
('atai-labs-pvt-ltd', 'ATAI Labs PVt LTd', 'startup', 'SCM AI Company which claims to have deep learning AI models and equipped with pre-trained real-world data to increase…', 'An applied AI company pioneering Digital Transformation for the Maritime, Logistics, and Supply Chain industries. Our innovative business models are targeted toward optimizing productivity and identifying opportunities for sustainability and cost efficiency. ATAI streamlines existing processes with true problem-solving applied AI solutions end-to-end. Powered by AI algorithms, sensors (Camera, Location sensors, Wireless mesh networks (LoRa, 5G, etc.), Lidar and Radar), and other cutting-edge technologies, ATAI has addressed a multitude of operational challenges across different market sectors.', 'https://www.atai.ai/', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Edtech', 'IT Services > Application Development', 'Seed', '2018', 'Gangadhar Gude', 'FalconX', '', 17.44722, 78.49547, '', 'live'),
