('takemebuddy', 'TakeMeBuddy', 'startup', 'Peer-to-peer ride sharing and micro mobility platform.', 'TakeMeBuddy is an urban ride-sharing and carpooling application connecting daily commuters along shared transit routes. The platform reduces urban traffic congestion and commuting costs by facilitating verified peer-to-peer travel. It provides a convenient, cost-effective, and eco-friendly commuting alternative for city professionals.', 'https://takemebuddy.com', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Others', 'TravelTech / Micro Mobility', 'Bootstrapped', '2020', 'Siva Prasad K, Ramesh V', 'Bootstrapped', 'Bootstrapped', 17.34377, 78.51924, '', 'live'),
('heal360', 'Heal360', 'startup', 'Integrated chronic disease management platform.', 'Heal360 offers remote patient monitoring and home-based chronic illness care management solutions. The platform connects patients with continuous vital tracking tools, virtual doctor consultations, and personalized diet and lifestyle plans. It helps healthcare providers manage post-discharge recovery and long-term diabetes or hypertension care.', 'https://heal360.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Healthtech', 'HealthTech / Remote Care', 'Seed', '2019', 'Dr. Suresh Reddy, Anita Rao', 'HealthTech Angels, Family Offices', '$800K', 17.34372, 78.45828, '', 'live'),
('agrix', 'AgriX', 'startup', 'Tech-enabled B2B agricultural trade platform.', 'AgriX operates a tech-driven supply chain platform connecting farmers directly with institutional buyers, food processors, and retailers. The platform provides quality grading, cold storage logistics, and transparent price discovery to eliminate middlemen. It streamlines fresh produce distribution and reduces post-harvest losses across regional agricultural markets.', 'https://agrix.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Agritech', 'AgriTech / Supply Chain', 'Seed', '2020', 'Nilay Pandey, Saurabh K', 'Caspian Impact, Ankur Capital', '$2.2M', 17.39775, 78.50398, '', 'live'),
('dhiway', 'Dhiway', 'startup', 'Decentralized verifiable data infrastructure.', 'Dhiway builds enterprise Web3 infrastructure and verifiable data exchange protocols (CORD Network) to ensure digital asset security and identity provenance. The platform enables organizations to issue, manage, and verify digital credentials and tamper-proof records. It provides scalable blockchain layer architecture for government, education, and enterprise deployment.', 'https://dhiway.com', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Deeptech', 'DeepTech / Web3 Data Infrastructure', 'Seed', '2019', 'Satish Mohan, Pradeep K', 'Cornerstone Venture Partners, 3One4 Capital', '$2.5M', 17.4196, 78.4586, '', 'live'),
('goli-soda', 'Goli Soda', 'startup', 'Eco-friendly sustainable products and zero-waste store.', 'Goli Soda is a D2C brand offering zero-waste personal care, eco-friendly home cleaning products, and sustainable lifestyle alternatives. The brand focuses on plastic-free packaging, non-toxic ingredients, and ethically sourced raw materials. It promotes sustainable consumer habits through conscious product design and eco-friendly retail options.', 'https://golisodastore.com', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'D2C & Consumer', 'D2C / Sustainable Lifestyle', 'Bootstrapped', '2018', 'Sruti Harihara Subramanian', 'Bootstrapped', 'Bootstrapped', 17.36713, 78.47541, '', 'live'),
('stanplus-red-health', 'StanPlus (Red Health)', 'startup', 'Tech-enabled emergency medical response & ambulance fleet.', 'RED Health (formerly StanPlus) operates a full-stack emergency response network delivering rapid ambulance dispatch and medical triage. The platform utilizes advanced telemetry, GPS routing, and trained paramedics to ensure fast response times during medical emergencies. It partners with hospitals and enterprises to deliver reliable critical care transport.', 'https://redhealth.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Healthtech', 'HealthTech / Emergency Medical Services', 'Series A', '2016', 'Prabhdeep Singh, Antoine Poirson, Jose Leon', 'HealthQuad, Kalaari Capital, JAFCO Asia', '$22M+', 17.42261, 78.50383, '', 'live'),
('thincite', 'ThinCite', 'startup', 'AI-powered legal research and case analysis platform.', 'ThinCite leverages artificial intelligence to streamline legal research, contract review, and case law analysis for legal professionals. The platform extracts actionable insights from extensive legal databases to reduce preparation time. It helps law firms and corporate legal teams make data-driven legal decisions efficiently.', 'https://thincite.com', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'AI', 'AI / LegalTech', 'Bootstrapped', '2021', 'Srikanth Reddy, Arvind Kumar', 'Bootstrapped', 'Bootstrapped', 17.38565, 78.51096, '', 'live'),
('truecap', 'Truecap', 'startup', 'Tech-enabled working capital financing for MSMEs.', 'Truecap offers tailored financial solutions and collateral-free business loans to small and medium enterprises. The platform utilizes alternative credit scoring models to evaluate business health and disburse capital quickly. It empowers underserved merchants and distributors across India to scale operational capacity.', 'https://truecapfinance.com', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Fintech', 'FinTech / MSME Lending', 'Series A', '2018', 'Rohan Juneja, Gautam K', 'Growth Catalyst Partners, Family Offices', '$8.5M', 17.34336, 78.52425, '', 'live'),
('swaraksha', 'Swaraksha', 'startup', 'Community health monitoring and preventive care network.', 'Swaraksha provides a digital preventive healthcare platform focused on early risk identification and wellness management. The application tracks vital health indicators, facilitates tele-consultations, and offers personalized wellness guidance. It bridges rural-urban healthcare access gaps through community-driven care initiatives.', 'https://swaraksha.org', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Healthtech', 'HealthTech / Preventive Care', 'Bootstrapped', '2020', 'Dr. Madhavi Latha, Rajesh V', 'Bootstrapped', 'Bootstrapped', 17.38638, 78.48325, '', 'live'),
('bintix', 'Bintix', 'startup', 'Data-driven municipal and doorstep waste management.', 'Bintix uses IoT and data analytics to digitize household dry waste collection and material recovery. The startup tracks waste sourcing to maximize recyclability, lower landfill dumping, and promote circular supply chains. It partners with municipal bodies and commercial brands for sustainable waste traceability.', 'https://bintix.com', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Cleantech', 'CleanTech / Waste Intelligence', 'Series A', '2018', 'Manish Sharma, Roshan Miranda', 'Caspian Impact Investment, Circularity Capital', '$3.2M', 17.39504, 78.50642, '', 'live'),
('cosmoserve', 'Cosmoserve', 'startup', 'In-orbit servicing and space debris remediation.', 'Cosmoserve designs autonomous satellite servicing vehicles dedicated to space debris management and orbital maintenance. The company develops robotic capture systems and de-orbiting tech to safeguard active satellite constellations. It aims to ensure long-term sustainability and collision avoidance in low Earth orbit.', 'https://cosmoserve.space', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Spacetech', 'Spacetech / Orbital Debris Removal', 'Seed', '2021', 'Abhishek C, Varun Kumar', 'Spacetech Angels, Defense Innovation Fund', '$1.8M', 17.40378, 78.49927, '', 'live'),
('perceptyne', 'Perceptyne', 'startup', 'AI-guided dexterous robots for manufacturing automation.', 'Perceptyne builds multi-modal AI and haptic sensing systems for industrial robot arms handling delicate assembly operations. Their robots combine computer vision and tactile feedback to automate complex manufacturing tasks previously requiring human dexterity. It boosts operational throughput for automotive and electronics assembly lines.', 'https://perceptyne.com', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Deeptech', 'DeepTech / Industrial Robotics', 'Seed', '2022', 'Raviteja S, Kshipra N', 'Endiya Partners, Speciale Invest', '$3.0M', 17.36861, 78.49973, '', 'live'),
('tohands', 'Tohands', 'startup', 'Smart financial calculator hardware for offline shopkeepers.', 'Tohands manufactures smart IoT-enabled financial calculators designed to replace traditional kirana ledger books. The hardware device automatically syncs daily sales, credit records, and analytics to a companion mobile app. It provides small offline retailers with simple, instant bookkeeping tools.', 'https://tohands.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Fintech', 'FinTech / Smart Calculators', 'Seed', '2021', 'Praveen Mishra, Satyam Sahu', 'Y Combinator, Venture Catalysts', '$1.5M', 17.38094, 78.51423, '', 'live'),
('bluj-aero', 'Bluj Aero', 'startup', 'Hydrogen fuel-cell VTOL aircraft for long-range cargo.', 'BluJAero develops zero-emission vertical takeoff and landing (VTOL) aircraft powered by hydrogen fuel cells. The propulsion system is engineered for heavy payload capacity and extended range in regional freight transport. It targets sustainable cargo logistics and emergency relief transport operations.', 'https://blujaero.com', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Deeptech', 'AeroTech / Hydrogen VTOL', 'Seed', '2022', 'Maruthi Amardeep Sri Vatsavaya', 'Specialist Aero Funds, Strategic Angels', '$2.0M', 17.37009, 78.52074, '', 'live'),
('tractrix-opto-dynamics', 'Tractrix Opto Dynamics', 'startup', 'Advanced electro-optical sensors for defense applications.', 'Tractrix Opto Dynamics develops precision thermal imaging, laser rangefinders, and electro-optical target tracking systems. The company supplies defense contractors and aerospace agencies with high-reliability optical sensors built for harsh environments. It strengthens indigenous defense manufacturing capability.', 'https://tractrix.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Deeptech', 'DefenseTech / Electro-Optics', 'Bootstrapped', '2021', 'Dr. S. K. Rao, Anil Verma', 'Bootstrapped', 'Bootstrapped', 17.37561, 78.44988, '', 'live'),
