('iit-hyderabad-fabci', 'IIT Hyderabad FABCI', 'incubator', 'National incubator for fabless semiconductor and chip design startups.', 'FABCI at IIT Hyderabad is India''s first incubator dedicated exclusively to fabless semiconductor design companies. It provides chip design ventures with expensive EDA software tools, silicon MPW shuttle access, and high-frequency testing equipment. The center enables semiconductor startups to design, prototype, and test indigenous integrated circuits with expert faculty support.', 'https://fabci.iith.ac.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Incubator', 'MeitY / IIT Hyderabad', '', '2017', 'IIT Hyderabad / MeitY Govt of India', 'MeitY C2S Scheme, IIT Hyderabad', 'Government Grant', 17.42831, 78.42866, '', 'live'),
('g-narayanamma-institute-tbi', 'G. Narayanamma Institute TBI', 'incubator', 'Women-centric engineering and technology business incubator.', 'Promotes technical entrepreneurship among women engineering students and alumni, offering seed assistance, hardware prototyping support, and business mentoring.', 'https://gnits.ac.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Incubator', 'GNITS Hyderabad / DST', '', '2019', 'GNITS Hyderabad / G. Pulla Reddy Trust', 'DST, GNITS Management Corpus', 'Institutional Grant', 17.34942, 78.53171, '', 'live'),
('jntuh-innovation-foundation', 'JNTUH Innovation Foundation', 'incubator', 'Central innovation network connecting JNTU affiliated engineering colleges across Telangana.', 'Supports student inventors, alumni founders, and faculty researchers with co-working space, maker labs, and seed grant access to accelerate engineering commercialization.', 'https://jntuh.ac.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Incubator', 'JNTU Hyderabad / Govt of Telangana', '', '2018', 'JNTU Hyderabad', 'Govt of Telangana, MSME Grants', 'Government Grant', 17.40028, 78.45639, '', 'live'),
('vnr-vjiet-e-cell', 'VNR VJIET E-Cell', 'incubator', 'Specialized academic center nurturing robotics, drone hardware, and computer vision startups.', 'Offers student hardware teams ROS computation rigs, high-precision CNC machines, and autonomous testing arenas. The incubator guides engineering founders from prototype design to formal venture incorporation.', 'https://vnrvjiet.ac.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Incubator', 'VNR VJIET Hyderabad', '', '2016', 'Vigyan Jyothi Society', 'VNR VJIET Corpus Fund', 'Self-Funded', 17.42486, 78.48417, '', 'live'),
('osmania-university-tbi', 'Osmania University TBI', 'incubator', 'University technology business incubator supporting regional youth innovation.', 'OU-TBI nurtures early-stage research spin-offs and student ventures across biotechnology, computer science, and material engineering. The center offers shared research equipment, patent filing guidance, and state startup grant connections.', 'https://osmania.ac.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Incubator', 'Osmania University / RUSA', '', '2017', 'Osmania University / MHRD Govt of India', 'RUSA Grant, Govt of Telangana', 'Government Grant', 17.38864, 78.5144, '', 'live'),
('hyderabad-angels-accelerator', 'Hyderabad Angels Accelerator', 'incubator', 'Early-stage startup syndication and acceleration platform.', 'Connects promising seed and Pre-Series A ventures across sectors with angel investors, active board mentors, and follow-on venture funds.', 'https://hyderabadangels.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Accelerator', 'Hyderabad Angels', '', '2012', 'Hyderabad Angels Network', 'Hyderabad Angels Syndicate', 'Private Angel Network', 17.35382, 78.49446, '', 'live'),
('cmrit-innovation-incubation-centre', 'CMRIT Innovation & Incubation Centre', 'incubator', 'Engineering campus incubator fostering IoT and renewable energy.', 'CMRIT Incubation Center fosters student-led hardware and software projects with dedicated electronic testing workstations and maker spaces. It offers structured pre-incubation programs guiding teams through product design, intellectual property protection, and business plan formation. The center facilitates interactions with regional industry associations and MSME grant schemes.', 'https://cmritonline.ac.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Incubator', 'CMR Group / Tech & Engineering', '', '2018', 'CMR Technical Education Society', 'CMR Group Corpus', 'Self-Funded', 17.35222, 78.44036, '', 'live'),
('malla-reddy-tbi', 'Malla Reddy TBI', 'incubator', 'Engineering incubator fostering student innovations in IoT, renewable energy, and software.', 'Provides co-working spaces, electronic testing benches, and intellectual property guidance for student inventors. The center actively assists campus startup teams in securing government MSME seed funding grants.', 'https://mrec.ac.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Incubator', 'Malla Reddy Group', '', '2019', 'Malla Reddy Educational Society', 'Malla Reddy Group', 'Self-Funded', 17.36064, 78.5194, '', 'live'),
('gokaraju-rangaraju-tbi', 'Gokaraju Rangaraju TBI', 'incubator', 'Specialized hardware prototyping center for student robotics, autonomous drones, and embedded systems.', 'GRIET Technology Business Incubator nurtures early-stage student innovation teams in robotics, renewable energy, and embedded systems. The facility offers access to advanced CAD design software, 3D printing equipment, and electrical testbeds. It organizes annual business plan competitions and assists student founders in securing government pre-seed grants.', 'https://griet.ac.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Incubator', 'GRIET Hyderabad', '', '2017', 'Gokaraju Rangaraju Educational Society', 'GRIET Management Corpus', 'Self-Funded', 17.42643, 78.50231, '', 'live'),
('sreenidhi-hub-snist-e-cell', 'Sreenidhi Hub (SNIST E-Cell)', 'incubator', 'Campus incubator backing student software SaaS, robotics, and embedded systems.', 'Provides student inventors with circuit printing equipment, micro-controller testbeds, and rapid 3D prototyping tools. The center helps engineering teams validate working hardware prototypes and apply for government MSME seed funding.', 'https://sreenidhi.edu.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Incubator', 'SNIST Hyderabad', '', '2016', 'Sreenidhi Educational Group', 'SNIST Management Corpus', 'Self-Funded', 17.35199, 78.43776, '', 'live'),
