('gitam-university-tbi-hyd', 'GITAM University TBI Hyd', 'incubator', 'Multi-disciplinary campus technology business incubator.', 'Offers shared lab space, business plan validation, and seed fund linkage for student and alumni entrepreneurs across Andhra Pradesh and Telangana.', 'https://gitam.edu', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Incubator', 'GITAM Hyderabad', '', '2018', 'GITAM Deemed University', 'GITAM University Corpus', 'Institutional Grant', 17.40176, 78.48609, '', 'live'),
