('t-works-prototyping-center-expanded-wing', 'T-Works Prototyping Center (Expanded Wing)', 'incubator', 'State-of-the-art hardware prototyping center equipping makers with industrial machinery.', 'T-Works provides hardware entrepreneurs access to laser cutters, 3D metal printers, PCB assembly lines, and wood-working shops. The facility accelerates physical hardware development from initial concept to market-ready manufacturing.', 'https://tworks.telangana.gov.in', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Incubator', 'Govt of Telangana', '', '2021', 'Govt of Telangana', 'Govt of Telangana', 'State Government Funded', 17.37845, 78.49973, '', 'live'),
